      "body": "`skills/manage-design-system/SKILL.md` (step \"Upload DESIGN.md\", option A) tells the agent to run\n`python3 stitch-skills/plugins/stitch-design/skills/upload-to-stitch/scripts/upload_to_stitch.py`.\nThat path is relative to a clone of this repository. When the plugin is installed through the\nmarketplace, the script lives at `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/upload-to-stitch/scripts/upload_to_stitch.py`,\nso the command fails from any project cwd. Suggest using `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}` (or a path relative\nto the skill) in the example.",
