      "body": "Tested on Windows 11 with Cursor. `npx plugins add --target cursor` completes but installs to `~/.cursor/extensions/` and skills don't show in `/`. `npx skills add -g -a cursor -y --skill \"*\"` installs to `~/.agents/skills/` and skills appear after restart.\r\n\r\nAlso documented the false-negative `Cursor was not detected` warning (plugins CLI uses `which cursor`, unavailable on Windows).",
